SUMMARY:Free Family Night
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Live Performances\, Art-Making\, Galleries After-Hours\nFamilie
 s with children of all ages are invited to Family Night at MASS MoCA on Th
 ursday\, November 12\, from 5:30 to 7:30pm. This free event will feature a
 fter-hours access to select exhibitions in the museum\, live performances\
 , art-making\, face painting\, a museum of mysteries quest\, food\, giveaw
 ays and fun!\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/family-night/\nFrom Pushpin Weste
 rn Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
